    "description": "Established 1984, Strongroom has produced some of the biggest records in British music and remains the largest independent recording studio in East London. \r\n\r\nFeaturing unique visual design by legendary artist Jamie Reid (Sex Pistols), these spaces are unlike any other. Reid's work draws from druidic culture and sacred geometry to convey vital messages of hope, environmentalism and anti-fascism.",
